    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Slavic Winter</strong>\u00a0<strong>Simulator</strong> is an authentic experience that recreates the celebration of New Year among residents of the post-Soviet space in the 2000s, offering nostalgic emotions. Throw snowballs at your in-game friends, enjoy the magical atmosphere of New Year from the 2000s, and relive the carefree days of childhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you can expect:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Photorealistic graphics</strong> on Unreal Engine, utilizing photogrammetry and Nanite technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A courtyard, stairwell, and several apartments to explore</strong>. No loading screens, just a single seamless world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Light up sparklers, launch fireworks</strong>. To light a sparkler, hold it to a working gas stove burner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play on a console</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Climb into other people's apartments via balconies</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Knock on neighbors' doors and wish them a Happy New Year</strong>. You can knock on over 30 apartments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>All items in the apartment are interactive</strong>: TV, gas stove, water taps, light switches, cupboards, doors, clothing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Before leaving the house, you need to put on shoes and a jacket</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can wear a Christmas hat of Grandfather Frost / Santa.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can eat tangerines, pies, and cakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can throw snowballs at the guys in the yard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cars drive along the streets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you throw a snowball at a car, its alarm will go off.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The magical atmosphere of childhood New Year celebrations</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Views from the windows of panel buildings</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3D graphics</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First-person perspective</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Fish-eye&quot;, &quot;VHS&quot;, and pixel art modes</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Slavic Winter</strong>\u00a0<strong>Simulator</strong> is an authentic experience that recreates the celebration of New Year among residents of the post-Soviet space in the 2000s, offering nostalgic emotions. Throw snowballs at your in-game friends, enjoy the magical atmosphere of New Year from the 2000s, and relive the carefree days of childhood.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this game, you can expect:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Photorealistic graphics</strong> on Unreal Engine, utilizing photogrammetry and Nanite technology.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>A courtyard, stairwell, and several apartments to explore</strong>. No loading screens, just a single seamless world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Light up sparklers, launch fireworks</strong>. To light a sparkler, hold it to a working gas stove burner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Play on a console</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Climb into other people's apartments via balconies</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Knock on neighbors' doors and wish them a Happy New Year</strong>. You can knock on over 30 apartments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>All items in the apartment are interactive</strong>: TV, gas stove, water taps, light switches, cupboards, doors, clothing.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Before leaving the house, you need to put on shoes and a jacket</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can wear a Christmas hat of Grandfather Frost / Santa.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can eat tangerines, pies, and cakes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You can throw snowballs at the guys in the yard.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cars drive along the streets.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you throw a snowball at a car, its alarm will go off.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The magical atmosphere of childhood New Year celebrations</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Views from the windows of panel buildings</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>3D graphics</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>First-person perspective</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>&quot;Fish-eye&quot;, &quot;VHS&quot;, and pixel art modes</strong>.</p></li></ul>",
